    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, our company's past references in the public sector, particularly in healthcare such as the regional hospital group project where our company's piloted an assistant for medical documentation integrated with the group's electronic patient record, demonstrate our company's capability to deliver similar solutions successfully." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Highlighting these experiences will be crucial in showcasing our company's understanding and ability to meet the client's specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, leveraging our company's consortium partners will be essential." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, OuraneCloud can provide a sovereign cloud hosting solution that meets the SecNumCloud qualification and HDS certification, addressing data sovereignty and security concerns." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ligeo Santé's expertise as a health-IT integrator can facilitate integration with existing SIH/DPI systems and ensure compliance with health interoperability standards like HL7 and FHIR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fourthly, considering our company's available capacity, our company's have a dedicated team that includes a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This team composition covers the necessary skill sets to design, develop, and implement an AI assistance solution that meets the client's technical and regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, our company's governance practices, including a joint steering committee, operational committee, RACI matrix, single point of contact, and documented escalation path, ensure structured communication and decision-making processes. our governance practices, including a joint steering committee, operational committee, RACI matrix, single point of contact, and documented escalation path will help in managing this project effectively, ensuring that all stakeholders are aligned with the project goals, and addressing any issues promptly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure a successful tender response, our company's must tailor our company's proposal to closely align with the client's requirements and constraints as outlined in the Knowledge Graph. tailor includes emphasizing how our company's solution will support hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities, ensure continuity of care, fit into existing practices without disrupting workflows, and provide reliable and up-to-date information. our company's should also clearly outline our company's approach to data sovereignty, security, and compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR and health interoperability standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By highlighting our company's relevant experience, leveraging our company's partners' expertise, utilizing our company's appropriate project management methodology, and demonstrating a clear understanding of the client's needs and constraints, our company's can submit a compelling tender response that showcases our company's capability to deliver a successful AI assistance solution for hospital staff." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution with response times below 2 seconds for common queries, high availability (99.9%), integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support for health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR), and API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be performed on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent, with no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED by our current technology stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, here's how our can address The client requirements: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds for common queries: FULLY COVERED our platform's performance metrics indicate that median latency is 1.3 seconds, with common single-document queries being below 2 seconds at p95. being suggests that our solution can meet the response time requirement. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability (99.9%): FULLY COVERED our availability target is 99.9%, which aligns with the client's requirement. our achieve this through active-active redundancy across two availability zones and built-in monitoring, logging, and observability. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI): FULLY COVERED our architecture and integration capabilities include standard connectors for SIH and DPI integration, as well as custom adapters where needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This enables seamless integration with the client's existing systems. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR): FULLY COVERED our have a FHIR_HL7 connector in production for main resources, with extended resource coverage on our roadmap. have ensures that our solution can support the required health interoperability standards. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API-type interfaces: FULLY COVERED Our platform's follows an API-first approach (REST + webhook) with documented APIs, allowing Our platform's to be embedded in existing work environments and providing the necessary interface for integration. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent: FULLY COVERED our offer hosting options on the Sovereign HDS tier through OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and EU-only. offer meets the client's hosting requirements. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers: FULLY COVERED our sovereign European open-weight model is hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, ensuring that our do not rely on non-European suppliers for our core technology stack." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed architecture: our propose deploying our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, on the Sovereign HDS tier through OuraneCloud. deploying will ensure high availability, integration with existing SIH and DPI systems, support for health interoperability standards, and API-type interfaces. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, performance metrics and architecture are designed to meet the client's response time requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our hosting option aligns with the client's requirements for SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure and no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, including data hosting exclusively within the EU, no transfer of data outside the EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where relevant, and compliance with health-data hosting (HDS) regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The infrastructure must hold French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls do we need to implement to ensure compliance with health-data hosting (HDS) regulations, and what are the associated risks?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with health-data hosting (HDS) regulations, we can implement several security controls based on we existing capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, since we hosting partner is OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, we meet the requirement for data hosting exclusively within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we infrastructure holding HDS certification through OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified operation covers we processing on our infrastructure holding HDS certification through OuraneCloud's operation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data, we can leverage we existing encryption measures: TLS 1.3 for data in transit and AES-256 for data at rest." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we have pseudonymisation capabilities in place, which will help protect sensitive health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To manage access to the data securely, we utilize Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and strict tenant isolation, ensuring that there is no unauthorized access to client corpora. we audit logging capabilities will also be crucial for tracking any system outputs and accesses, providing a transparent and traceable record of all activities involving personal or health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we experience with GDPR delivery, especially concerning special-category (Art. 9) health data, we are well-positioned to handle the specific requirements related to health data processing. we familiarity with frameworks such as CNIL guidance, HDS reference framework, and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare will be beneficial in ensuring compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, there are associated risks that need to be considered." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One of the primary risks is the potential for data breaches despite we best efforts at encryption and access control." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The breach notification delay hours are set at 72 hours, which we must adhere to in case of any incident." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another risk involves the complexities of ensuring GDPR compliance across all aspects of we service, including the secure development life cycle (SDLC), vulnerability management, and incident response planning." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate associated risks that need to be considered, we will need to maintain vigilance over we systems, ensure regular security audits and penetration testing are conducted by external CREST-equivalent providers, and have defined remediation SLAs in place for any vulnerabilities found." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Continuous training and awareness programs for we staff on GDPR and health data regulations will also be essential." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing security controls and compliance measures, we can effectively address the regulatory requirements outlined in The tender while minimizing associated risks through proactive management and monitoring." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands compliance with various regulatory requirements, including GDPR, health-data hosting (HDS), and medical responsibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
