    <http://example.org/node/chunk171> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "That being said, if our assume that our total revenue from this contract will be 900,000 over 5 years, our projected margin on this contract would be between 25% and 35% of our total revenue from this contract, which translates to 225,000 to 315,000. 225,000 to 315,000 represents the potential gross profit our could earn from this contract." ;
