    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs and propose a cost-effective approach, our can consider the following strategies: 1. **Favoring configurations that protect the gross margin and recurring-cost predictability**: our can offer tiered pricing models or flexible payment plans to ensure that our costs are aligned with The client's budgetary capacity. 2. **Arbitrating toward more cost-efficient tiers/models**: Where possible, our can recommend sovereign HDS tier and sovereign European model options, which are more cost-efficient on the recurring side compared to premium high-availability tiers combined with top-tier proprietary inference. 3. **Maintaining a five-year cost model that can be re-run if requirements or budget change**: our can work closely with the client to monitor and adjust our cost structure as needed, ensuring that our remain within the client budgetary constraints while delivering the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

